      "cooked": "<p>In Issue 6, a certain villain has an ability called \"Behold My Genius!\" that allows him to \"Attack using Weaponry...\" The villain, however, does not have any power or quality named \"Weaponry.\" So, which power or quality should he be using with this ability?</p><p>Since I'm running this tonight and unlikely to get an official answer, I'm planning on letting him use \"Mech-Suit Offenses\" until the suit is disabled, then \"Metal Someone-Tech Arm\" after.</p>",
